[h2]Build 0.9.29[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Softer cushion seams on the sectional.[/b] The hard line between neighbouring seats is now a soft crease that fades into each cushion, so a long couch reads as one piece of furniture instead of a row of tiles. The conversation pit's seats get the same treatment.
[/list]
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Room divider corners.[/b] Where a divider turned a corner, the face-on panel stuck out half a tile past the turn. The corner is now a single panel hinged on its centre post, so L and U shaped screens meet cleanly.
[/list]
[list]
[*]Art only: no gameplay changes. Safe to update mid-save.
[/list]
